---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="container">
  <div class="poll">
    <h2 class="label">Player's Contact</h2>
    <p>함께 고민할 문제가 있다면 언제든 연락 주세요.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="chip chip-submit" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>
      <a class="chip" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/Mireutale</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bar micro">
    <span>©{year} {profile.name}. All rights reserved.</span>
    <span class="badge">BUILT WITH ASTRO</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    margin-top: var(--s-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-xl);
  }
  .poll {
    padding: var(--s-md);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    background: var(--c-periwinkle);
    box-shadow: var(--bevel-plate);
  }
  .poll p {
    margin-top: var(--s-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--s-sm);
    margin-top: var(--s-md);
  }
  .actions .chip {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--s-sm);
    margin-top: var(--s-sm);
    padding: var(--s-lg);
    background: var(--c-carbon);
    background-image: var(--halftone);
    background-size: 4px 4px;
    color: var(--c-canvas-soft);
    clip-path: var(--chamfer);
  }
  .badge {
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--r-xs);
    background: var(--c-amber);
    color: var(--c-carbon);
  }
</style>
